<title>USA: Smith International Q1 shr $0.53 vs $0.33.</title>
<headline>Smith International Q1 shr $0.53 vs $0.33.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							    March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997		1996</p>
<p>							 (Unaudited)</p>
<p> Revenues				    $ 357,484	$ 238,820</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of Revenues			  236,219	  157,911</p>
<p>   Selling Expenses			   56,287	   41,826</p>
<p>General and Administrative</p>
<p>     Expenses				   19,953	   14,033</p>
<p> Total Costs and Expenses		312,459	  213,770</p>
<p>Earnings before Interest</p>
<p>     and Taxes				  45,025	   25,050</p>
<p>   Interest expense, net		     5,234	    3,039</p>
<p>Income before income taxes and</p>
<p>     minority interests		     39,791	   22,011</p>
<p>   Income tax provision			9,967	    5,015</p>
<p>Income before minority</p>
<p>     interests				  29,824	   16,996</p>
<p>   Minority Interests			  8,711	    4,048</p>
<p>    Net income				   21,113	   12,948</p>
<p>   Earnings per share			   0.53	     0.33</p>
<p>Weighted average common and common equivalent</p>
<p>     shares outstanding		     40,068	   39,719</p>
<p>OTHER DATA:</p>
<p> Depreciation and Amortization	     9,166	    7,093</p>
<p> Capital Spending (A)			 14,708	   14,075</p>
<p>EBIT excluding minority</p>
<p>   interests (B)				34,927	   19,697</p>
<p>EBITDA excluding minority</p>
<p>   interests (B)				42,569	   25,559</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>Note (A): Capital spending is reported gross and not reduced for the proceeds arising on lost-in-hole sales or sales of fixed asset equipment replaced. The net capital spending was $13.2 million and $10.7 million for the first quarter of 1997 and 1996.</p>
<p>Note (B): EBIT excluding minority interests and EBITDA excluding minority interests represent the amount of EBIT and EBITDA earned by the company after reduction for the portion of the respective amounts allocable to the minority interest ownership in M-I Drilling Fluids L.L.C.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Smith International Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
